olor:#18911f}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .cs1-maint{color:#18911f}}\n    </style>\n    <cite class=\"citation journal\">\n     Lemaitre, Anne; Morbidelli, Alessandro.\n     <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://link.springer.com/10.1007/BF00693091\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      Proper elements for highly inclined asteroidal orbits\n     </a>\n     . Celestial Mechanics &amp; Dynamical Astronomy. 1994-09,\n     <b>\n      60\n     </b>\n     (1): 29.\n     <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/1994CeMDA..60...29L\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <span title=\"Bibcode\">\n       Bibcode:1994CeMDA..60...29L\n      </span>\n     </a>\n     .\n     <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.worldcat.org/issn/0923-2958\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <span title=\"国际标准连续出版物号\">\n       ISSN 0923-2958\n      </span>\n     </a>\n     .\n     <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//doi.org/10.1007%2FBF00693091\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007%2FBF00693091\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <span title=\"數位物件識別號\">\n       doi:10.1007/BF00693091\n      </span>\n     </a>\n     <span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;\" title=\"连接到英语网页\">\n      （英语）\n     </span>\n     .\n    </cite>\n    <span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E6%99%BA%E7%A5%9E%E6%98%9F%E6%97%8F&amp;rft.atitle=Proper+elements+for+highly+inclined+asteroidal+orbits&amp;rft.au=Morbidelli%2C+Alessandro&amp;rft.aufirst=Anne&amp;rft.aulast=Lemaitre&amp;rft.date=1994-09&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.issn=0923-2958&amp;rft.issue=1&amp;rft.jtitle=Celestial+Mechanics+%26+Dynamical+Astronomy&amp;rft.pages=29&amp;rft.volume=60&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Flink.springer.com%2F10.1007%2FBF00693091&amp;rft_id=info%3Abibcode%2F1994CeMDA..60...29L&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1007%2FBF00693091&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\">\n     <span style=\"display:none;\">\n     </span>\n    </span>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r92366446\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/>\n    <cite class=\"citation journal\">\n     Kozai, Y.\n     <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/1979IAUS...81..231K\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      Secular Perturbations of Asteroids and Comets\n     </a>\n     . Dynamics of the Solar System. 1979,\n     <b>\n      81\n     </b>\n     : 236-237\n     <span class=\"reference-accessdate\">\n      [\n      <span class=\"nowrap\">\n       2025-02-27\n      </span>\n      ]\n     </span>\n     .\n     <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/1979IAUS...81..231K\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <span title=\"Bibcode\">\n       Bibcode:1979IAUS...81..231K\n      </span>\n     </a>\n     .\n     <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.worldcat.org/issn/1743-9221\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <span title=\"国际标准连续出版物号\">\n       ISSN 1743-9221\n      </span>\n     </a>\n     . （原始内容\n     <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250227144352/https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/1979IAUS...81..231K\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      存档\n     </a>\n     于2025-02-27）\n     <span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;\" title=\"连接到英语网页\">\n      （英语）\n     </span>\n     .\n    </cite>\n    <span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E6%99%BA%E7%A5%9E%E6%98%9F%E6%97%8F&amp;rft.atitle=Secular+Perturbations+of+Asteroids+and+Comets&amp;rft.aufirst=Y.&amp;rft.aulast=Kozai&amp;rft.date=1979&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.issn=1743-9221&amp;rft.jtitle=Dynamics+of+the+Solar+System&amp;rft.pages=236-237&amp;rft.volume=81&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fui.adsabs.harvard.edu%2Fabs%2F1979IAUS...81..231K&amp;rft_id=info%3Abibcode%2F1979IAUS...81..231K&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\">\n     <span style=\"display:none;\">\n     </span>\n    </span>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    A. Cellino et al \"Spectroscopic Properties of Asteroid Families\", in\n    <i>\n     Asteroids III\n    </i>\n    , p. 633-643, University of Arizona Press (2002). (Table on page 636, in particular).\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://cfa-www.harvard.edu/iau/MPCORB.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     MPCORB orbit database\n    </a>\n    （\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20070630200217/http://cfa-www.harvard.edu/iau/MPCORB.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     页面存档备份\n    </a>\n    ，存于\n    <a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"互联网档案馆\">\n     互联网档案馆\n    </a>\n    ）\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.eqiad.main‐6d4b9c8b8d‐2bpk9\nCached time: 20260606141453\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Citation/CS1 (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.114 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.145 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 143/1000000\nRevision size: 3027/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 6466/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 112/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4396/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.058/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1815552/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n  <!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   91.114      1 -total\n 97.29%   88.642      2 Template:Cite_journal\n  1.91%    1.741      2 Template:Wayback\n-->\n  <!-- Render ID 16377ed1-61b2-11f1-8b60-0dcd68ec0ffe -->\n  <!-- Saved in parser cache with key zhwiki:pcache:573713:|#|:idhash:canonical!zh and timestamp 20260606141453 and revision id 87644010. Rendering was triggered because: page_view\n -->\n </div>\n <noscript>\n  <img alt=\"\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:CentralAutoLogin/start?useformat=desktop&amp;type=1x1&amp;usesul3=1\" style=\"border: none; position: absolute;\" width=\"1\"/>\n </noscript>\n <div class=\"printfooter\" data-nosnippet=\"\">\n  检索自“\n  <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=智神星族&amp;oldid=87644010\">\n   https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=智神星族&amp;oldid=87644010\n  </a>\n  ”\n </div>\n</div>\n",
  "raw_text": "智神星族\n\n小行星家族\n\n，特徵是位於\n\n中間，有高傾角的\n\n（Cellino et al (2002)）.\n\n為首的智神星是平均直徑530公里的巨大小行星，其他的成員則都非常小（最大的是5222 Ioffe，估計直徑只有22公里。），這暗示了其他成員可能都是經由所謂的\n\n隕石坑化\n\n，由撞擊才從智神星分離出來的。\n\n智神星族的位置和組織。\n\n由圖可見她們的\n\n固有軌道元素\n\n都在相近的範圍內。\n\n2.71\n\n0.25\n\n2.79 AU\n\n0.31\n\n軌道元素\n\n範圍可以參考MPCORB的資料庫\n\n页面存档备份\n\n互联网档案馆\n\n）)，大約在\n\n2.71\n\n0.13\n\n2.79 AU\n\n0.37\n\n看起來這個家族真的是經由對智神星的撞擊形成的，因為家族成員的光譜都是罕見的\n\n。這個家族最早是在1928年被\n\n平山清次\n\n注意到，稍後也被布勞艾（Brouwer，1951年）、Kozai（1979年）和勒麥特與莫比德利（Lemaitre & Morbidelli，1994年）注意到。\n\n參考資料\n\nLemaitre, Anne; Morbidelli, Alessandro.\n\nProper elements for highly inclined asteroidal orbits\n\n. Celestial Mechanics & Dynamical Astronomy. 1994-09,\n\n(1): 29.\n\nBibcode:1994CeMDA..60...29L\n\nISSN 0923-2958\n\ndoi:10.1007/BF00693091\n\n（英语）\n\nKozai, Y.\n\nSecular Perturbations of Asteroids and Comets\n\n. Dynamics of the Solar System. 1979,\n\n: 236-237\n\n2025-02-27\n\nBibcode:1979IAUS...81..231K\n\nISSN 1743-9221\n\n. （原始内容\n\n于2025-02-27）\n\n（英语）\n\nA. Cellino et al \"Spectroscopic Properties of Asteroid Families\", in\n\nAsteroids III\n\n, p. 633-643, University of Arizona Press (2002). (Table on page 636, in particular).\n\nMPCORB orbit database\n\n页面存档备份\n\n互联网档案馆\n\n检索自“\n\nhttps://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=智神星族&oldid=87644010",
